raye-update (0.5.2~beta1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * "Preparing updates" shows as soon as a restart that installs updates
    begins, instead of "Restarting".
  * A late percentage from apt no longer comes back on the boot screen
    after the install, and the same number is sent only once.
  * The taskbar progress watch no longer hits its start limit during an
    install, and the upgrade starts it again if it had.
  * The new shutdown screen unit counts from the first restart after the
    upgrade.

